{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"world_three_realms","name_zh":"三界","name_en":"Three Realms","aliases":["三界","Three Realms"],"category":"cosmology","scope":"global","regions":[],"summary":"三界是由光界、人界与虚无界（虚界）构成的世界结构。三者的力量分别表现为元素奔流、地脉与暗流，可在同一区域相互影响；不同区域可能由某一界的力量占据优势，也可能维持平衡。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_01","text":"三界包括光界、人界与虚无界；虚无界也简称「虚界」。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现行世界结构","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_realms","fandom_sup_world_three_realms_01","local_sup_world_three_realms_02"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_02","text":"白夜国住民所说的三个世界是龙蜥界、人间界和虚无界；其中「龙蜥界」是光界的别称，指纯粹、原始的元素生物世界。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"白夜国相关知识传统","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_world_three_realms_02"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_03","text":"三界并非必然彼此分隔的地点；Fandom正文将其描述为能够在同一空间并存的世界侧面，一处区域可能由某一界的力量主导，也可能保持三界影响的平衡。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"现行世界结构","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_realms","fandom_sup_world_three_realms_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_04","text":"三界各有相应的力量表现：人界对应地脉，光界对应元素奔流，虚界对应暗流。渊下宫是这三类力量都很强的地方。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"三界路飨祭时期及相关知识传统","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_realms","fandom_sup_world_three_realms_01","local_sup_world_three_realms_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_05","text":"阿祇称，光界的七王是代表蛮荒、原始元素力之顶的元素七龙。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"白夜国相关知识传统","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_world_three_realms_02"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_06","text":"三界路飨祭期间，渊下宫的虚界黑雾压制了光界和人界之物，使其变化停滞；虚无深渊的黑暗也令人与龙蜥无法忍受，散布的深渊力量会使珊瑚王虫和深海龙蜥痛苦。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"三界路飨祭期间","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_world_three_realms_01","local_sup_world_three_realms_02","local_sup_world_three_realms_03"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_07","text":"阿祇称，珊瑚王虫能够把荒蛮元素转化为适合人类世界的温和元素；其大规模苏醒会改变渊下宫的环境生态。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"海祇御灵祭及三界路飨祭时期","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_world_three_realms_03"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_08","text":"Fandom正文记述，天理降临后战胜光界的七王、支配自然与光界，并以燃素为基础形成七种元素的元素能量，随后创造了包括神与人类在内的人界。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"上古创世阶段","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_realms","fandom_sup_world_three_realms_01"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_09","text":"夜神称燃素是提瓦特原初的力量，元素力是天理在燃素基础上为应对深渊威胁而改造的力量；她以古代与现代之力的关系类比光界力与人界力。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"第五章第四幕时期所述的上古历史","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_world_three_realms_04"]},{"fact_id":"world_three_realms_fact_10","text":"Fandom正文记述，人界生物与作为元素生物的光界生物在提瓦特大陆共存，但两界之间也会发生冲突；虚界力量则会威胁另外两界的生物。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"现行世界结构","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_realms","fandom_sup_world_three_realms_01"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"天理降临后的上古阶段","order_hint":10,"events":["据Fandom正文，天理战胜光界七王并支配光界与自然。","天理以燃素为基础形成七种元素的元素能量，随后创造人界、神与人类。"],"current_status":"该创世顺序在本证据包中仅由Fandom正文转述，缺少相应直接游戏文本。","source_ids":["fandom_world_three_realms","fandom_sup_world_three_realms_01"]},{"period":"三界路飨祭期间","order_hint":20,"events":["虚界之塔散布深渊力量，虚界黑雾在渊下宫蔓延。","黑雾压制光界与人界之物，使当地生态变化停滞。","当时提出的消除黑雾方法是启动塔顶的光界之锥凿，将光界力量导入当地。"],"current_status":"证据描述了当时的入侵及应对目标，但未在所收录文本中证明黑雾最终如何消退。","source_ids":["local_sup_world_three_realms_01","local_sup_world_three_realms_02","local_sup_world_three_realms_03"]},{"period":"第五章第四幕时期","order_hint":30,"events":["夜神进一步说明燃素、元素力以及光界力与人界力之间的古今关系。"],"current_status":"该说明补充了光界力与人界力的历史关系，但没有完整解释三界的形成机制。","source_ids":["local_sup_world_three_realms_04"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"白夜国传统中存在龙蜥界、人间界与虚无界的三世界观念；三界力量及其历史关系属于较专门的知识，并非普遍常识。","likely_known_by":["白夜国或渊下宫相关文献的研究者","阿祇、旅行者与派蒙等三界路飨祭亲历者","掌握上古世界知识者，如夜神"],"unlikely_known_by":["未接触白夜国文献或上古知识的普通居民","不了解渊下宫与深渊现象的人"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["白夜国住民把光界称为「龙蜥界」，把人界称为「人间界」。","可能有人因深海龙蜥厌恶光而误以为它们能够承受虚无深渊的黑暗；阿祇明确称这种黑暗让龙蜥与人都无法忍受。"]},"activation_keys":["三界","Three Realms"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["睦疏之匣的使用、强化、能量恢复与供奉操作。","虚界之塔的探索顺序、地图标记、任务目标及战斗要求。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["Fandom杂项部分提出的「人界可能建立在光界之上或以光界为基础」未作为确定事实收录。","根据中英文术语差异推断光界与人界的区别在于元素力量承载量，属于编辑者推断。","光界与人界必然合作对抗虚界的说法未获当前证据充分确认。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_world_three_realms","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Realm","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Realm","language":"en","revision_id":"1879679","source_text_sha256":"815e3dcfa814a3c7dd65a84c908775728b1226c1b1578362bea9a876643d2a8a"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_world_three_realms_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Realm","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Realm","language":"en","revision_id":"1879679","source_text_sha256":"10d09ebb5b160177b82e229d760156c3c66bc30e22172c0d9af4d20608a11ba0"},{"source_id":"local_sup_world_three_realms_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"三界路飨祭·前夜","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_40047.json#unit=4004717","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"5ca2662b12f8c8097ca14e996d1f25624bb2f602bf0a0d8e042cbaf82d11d93b"},{"source_id":"local_sup_world_three_realms_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"三界路飨祭·前夜","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_40047.json#unit=4004705","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"d1760d22223e614a02a1f751ca1a34d649d0f6a2022d2ea8dacf180d3f82fd4b"},{"source_id":"local_sup_world_three_realms_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"三界路飨祭·前夜","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_40047.json#unit=4004715","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"a6172cac386d773b5b151b45b09ac0cf47bda3104a1c826ef585230985d0e1e8"},{"source_id":"local_sup_world_three_realms_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"秘源之下","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_5009.json#unit=500903","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"3bcee0896389fececbeca4953b6977b0f4636f48c8de0325425c9a4945f5c3d1"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"86c2058c88458c7f6d26d9218b2335b5e33fbd2e832f2afcb5296a6b5b46a4e8","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["三界作为可在同一空间并存的世界侧面，是Fandom正文使用推测语气提出的概括，缺少当前证据包中的直接游戏文本确认。","天理征服光界、创造人界、神与人类的完整顺序仅见Fandom正文转述。","人界地脉、光界元素奔流与虚界暗流的具体性质仍不明确。"],"missing_evidence":["缺少直接游戏文本完整说明天理征服光界并创造人界、神与人类的过程。"],"needs_human_review":true}}